# Marmalade Open Press, made by Marmalade (https://marmalade.family). Copyright (c) 2026 East Hill. MIT licence.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Marmalade Open Press
abstract: >-
  A Node tool and library that turns an HTML page into a print-ready CMYK PDF/X-4,
  converted through the printer's ICC profile, with greys and blacks on the black plate alone
  and an optional rich-black underlay. It also writes PDF/X-1a, PDF/X-3 and CMYK TIFF through Ghostscript.
  Made by Marmalade, the app that turns a family's week into a printed magazine.
authors:
  - name: East Hill
    website: https://marmalade.family
version: 1.0.1
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/easthillcc/marmalade-open-press
url: https://github.com/easthillcc/marmalade-open-press
